'''An Ancient Curse''' is the first stage in [[Uncanny Legends]] and the only stage in [[A New Legend]]. [[Relic Doge]] and [[Relic Bun-Bun]] are introduced here. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

Upon completion, [[Mecha-Bun (Special Cat)|Mecha-Bun]] can be upgraded to its [[True Form]] using [[Catfruit]] and XP. In addition, [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cats]] can be hypermaxed to Lv.40 using [[Catseye]]s, while all other cats that could previously be hypermaxed (i.e. excluding the likes of [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normals]], [[Metal Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Metal Cat]], [[:Category:JRA|JRA Cats]] and the [[Heartbeat Catcademy (Event Gacha)|Heartbeat Catcademy]] cats) can be upgraded to Lv.50 the same way. The [[Otherworld Colosseum]] will also become available.

